    2. pick bar_len in [1,4]
    3. pick one of 4 cardinal directions for bar
    4. compute CW-rotated direction
    5. place pivot so bar_len cells fit in both original and rotated directions from pivot, and rotated cells do not overlap bar cells
    6. fill grid BLACK, place GREY pivot, paint RED bar of bar_len extending from pivot in chosen direction
```
